<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Chirisamhuru II</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">killed c. 1836</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Chirisamhuru II was the last <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/changamire">Changamire</a> ruler of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rozvi-empire">Rozvi Empire</a>. The Rozvi state was weakened in the early nineteenth century by invasions of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nguni">Nguni</a> groups from the south during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mfecane">Mfecane</a>. He was killed around 1836 by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/swati">Swati</a> forces of Queen Nyamazana, ending the empire.</p></div>
